    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8azpk2f",
      "content": "Engineering materials are substances used to manufacture machine parts, tools, structures, and equipment used in industries and workshops. Selection of the correct material is very important because different materials have different properties such as strength, hardness, ductility, conductivity, and durability."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "gd6a9j6",
      "content": "In technical trades like fitting, machining, electrical work, and construction, knowledge of engineering materials helps workers choose the right material for specific applications."
    },
